  "_readable": "All 53 resolve on the testnet indexer. Creating an atom does not make it readable: the indexer resolves value.thing from the pinned CID, so scripts/seed/pin-tool.ts ran over every URL afterwards. One atom (Alchemy) stayed 'Unknown' for several minutes and resolved after a re-pin \u2014 pinning is content-addressed, so a re-pin is free and changes no id.",
